# Layout and behavior are shared by Slate, Dune, Grove, and Ink.
# One page per workspace prevents accidental edge panning into hidden pages.
DesktopConfiguration global
DesktopSize 1x1
DesktopName 0 Main
DesktopName 1 Work
DesktopName 2 Focus
DesktopName 3 Other
EdgeScroll 0 0
EdgeThickness 0
ClickTime 250
MoveThreshold 3
IgnoreModifiers L25
DefaultFont "$[infostore.slate_font]"
Style * Font "$[infostore.slate_font]"
Style * ClickToFocus, MouseFocusClickRaises, MinOverlapPlacement
Style * GrabFocusOff, !UsePPosition, DecorateTransient, StackTransientParent
Style * FPGrabFocusTransient, FPReleaseFocusTransient
Style * BorderWidth 1, HandleWidth 4, Colorset 1, HilightColorset 2
Style * BorderColorset 3, HilightBorderColorset 4, !Icon
Style * SnapAttraction 12 SameType Screen, SnapGrid 1 1
Style * ResizeOpaque, WindowShadeSteps 0
OpaqueMoveSize unlimited

# Flat vector controls need no bitmap icons or special icon font.
TitleStyle LeftJustified Height 28 -- Flat
ButtonStyle All Simple -- Flat
ButtonStyle 1 Vector 4 35x35@3 65x35@3 35x65@4 65x65@3 -- Flat
ButtonStyle 2 Vector 4 35x35@3 65x65@3 35x65@4 65x35@3 -- Flat
ButtonStyle 4 Vector 5 32x32@3 68x32@3 68x68@3 32x68@3 32x32@3 -- Flat
ButtonStyle 6 Vector 2 32x65@3 68x65@3 -- Flat
ButtonStyle 1 - MwmDecorMenu
ButtonStyle 4 - MwmDecorMax
ButtonStyle 6 - MwmDecorMin
BorderStyle Simple -- NoInset Flat

# Native FVWM menus support keyboard navigation and type-to-select.
# Search opens a form and returns a filtered list. Discovery never uses PipeRead.
MenuStyle * FVWM, Font "$[infostore.slate_font]", MenuColorset 5, \
    ActiveColorset 6, GreyedColorset 7, TitleColorset 8, BorderWidth 1, \
    Hilight3DOff, PopupDelay 150, PopdownDelay 150, !Animation, \
    VerticalItemSpacing 8 8, VerticalTitleSpacing 10 10
CopyMenuStyle * SlateLauncherStyle
MenuStyle SlateLauncherStyle ItemFormat "%24p%l%80p%>%24p"
DestroyFunc SlateLauncher
AddToFunc SlateLauncher
+ I Menu SlateLauncherMenu Monitor c c
DestroyFunc SlatePalette
AddToFunc SlatePalette
+ I SendToModule FvwmDesktop palette
DestroyFunc SlateMove
AddToFunc SlateMove
+ I Raise
+ M Move
+ D Maximize
DestroyFunc SlateResize
AddToFunc SlateResize
+ I Raise
+ M Resize
DestroyFunc SlateSendDesk
AddToFunc SlateSendDesk
+ I MoveToDesk 0 $0
DestroyFunc SlateDesk
AddToFunc SlateDesk
+ I SendToModule SlateBar ChangeButton desk0 Colorset 10
+ I SendToModule SlateBar ChangeButton desk1 Colorset 10
+ I SendToModule SlateBar ChangeButton desk2 Colorset 10
+ I SendToModule SlateBar ChangeButton desk3 Colorset 10
+ I SendToModule SlateBar ChangeButton desk$[desk.n] Colorset 11

# Rebuild the bar on topology changes, without restarting application windows.
# Only the primary monitor reserves a top edge; other monitors remain free.
DestroyFunc SlatePanel
AddToFunc SlatePanel
+ I SendToModule SlateTray Hide
+ I KillModule FvwmButtons SlateBar
+ I EwmhBaseStruts 0 0 0 0
+ I EwmhBaseStruts screen $[monitor.primary] 0 0 $[infostore.slate_height] 0
+ I DestroyModuleConfig SlateBar:*
+ I *SlateBar: Geometry $[monitor.$[monitor.primary].width]x$[infostore.slate_height]+0+0@p
+ I *SlateBar: Colorset 10
+ I *SlateBar: ActiveColorset 12
+ I *SlateBar: Rows 1
+ I *SlateBar: Layout content
+ I *SlateBar: Columns 100
+ I *SlateBar: Frame 0
+ I *SlateBar: Padding 6 0
+ I *SlateBar: Font "$[infostore.slate_font]"
+ I *SlateBar: StartupAction SendToModule FvwmDesktop refresh $[monitor.$[monitor.primary].width]
+ I *SlateBar: (12x1, Title "Applications", Action SlateLauncher)
+ I *SlateBar: (3x1, Id desk0, Title "1", Action GotoDesk 0 0)
+ I *SlateBar: (3x1, Id desk1, Title "2", Action GotoDesk 0 1)
+ I *SlateBar: (3x1, Id desk2, Title "3", Action GotoDesk 0 2)
+ I *SlateBar: (3x1, Id desk3, Title "4", Action GotoDesk 0 3)
+ I *SlateBar: (10x1, Title "Windows", Action WindowList Monitor c c NoGeometry)
+ I *SlateBar: (24x1, Id clock, Title "FVWM-X", Action SendToModule FvwmDesktop calendar)
+ I *SlateBar: (8x1, Id tray, Title "Tray", Disabled, Action SendToModule SlateTray ToggleAt $left $top $width $height)
+ I *SlateBar: (16x1, Id status, Title "System", Action Menu SlateSystem Monitor c c)
+ I *SlateBar: (9x1, Id appearance, Title "Slate", Action Menu SlateAppearance Monitor c c)
+ I *SlateBar: (9x1, Title "Session", Action Menu SlateSession Monitor c c)
+ I Module FvwmButtons SlateBar
Style SlateBar !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, WindowListSkip, \
    NeverFocus, Layer 6, FixedPosition, FixedSize
Style Slate*Form PositionPlacement Center, WindowListSkip, Layer 6
Style SlateNoticeForm !Title, WindowListSkip, Layer 6, NeverFocus, UsePPosition
Style FvwmPager WindowListSkip, Layer 6
Style FvwmIdent WindowListSkip

# Forms share the desktop palette. They never grab the X server.
*FvwmFormDefault: Font "$[infostore.slate_font]"
*FvwmFormDefault: InputFont "$[infostore.slate_font]"
*FvwmFormDefault: ButtonFont "$[infostore.slate_font]"
*FvwmFormDefault: Colorset 0
*FvwmFormDefault: ItemColorset 12
*FvwmFormDefault: PadVText 12
*SlateSearchForm: Title "Search applications"
*SlateSearchForm: Line left
*SlateSearchForm: Text "Find an application by name"
*SlateSearchForm: Line left
*SlateSearchForm: Input query 36 ""
*SlateSearchForm: Line expand
*SlateSearchForm: Button quit "Search" ^M
*SlateSearchForm: Command SendToModule FvwmDesktop search $(query)
*SlateSearchForm: Button quit "Cancel" ^[
*SlateSearchForm: Command Nop
*SlateRunForm: Title "Run command"
*SlateRunForm: Line left
*SlateRunForm: Text "Run a command with your login environment"
*SlateRunForm: Line left
*SlateRunForm: Input command 40 ""
*SlateRunForm: Line expand
*SlateRunForm: Button quit "Run" ^M
*SlateRunForm: Command SendToModule FvwmDesktop run $(command)
*SlateRunForm: Button quit "Cancel" ^[
*SlateRunForm: Command Nop

# Bootstrap menus remain usable before background discovery finishes.
DestroyMenu SlateLauncherMenu
AddToMenu SlateLauncherMenu "Applications" Title
+ "Action palette..." SlatePalette
+ "Terminal" SendToModule FvwmDesktop terminal
+ "Search applications..." Module FvwmForm SlateSearchForm
+ "Run command..." Module FvwmForm SlateRunForm
+ "Files" SendToModule FvwmDesktop files
+ "Workspaces" Module FvwmPager 0 3
+ "Appearance" Popup SlateAppearance
+ "System" Popup SlateSystem
+ "Session" Popup SlateSession
DestroyMenu SlateAppearance
AddToMenu SlateAppearance "Appearance" Title
+ "Loading desktop settings..." Greyed
DestroyMenu SlateSystem
AddToMenu SlateSystem "System" Title
+ "Loading system services..." Greyed
DestroyMenu SlateSession
AddToMenu SlateSession "Session" Title
+ "Lock" SendToModule FvwmDesktop lock
+ "Log out..." SendToModule FvwmDesktop confirm logout
+ "Restart FVWM" Restart
+ "Power off..." SendToModule FvwmDesktop confirm poweroff
+ "Reboot..." SendToModule FvwmDesktop confirm reboot
DestroyMenu SlateWindow
AddToMenu SlateWindow "Window" Title
+ "Move" Move
+ "Resize" Resize
+ "Minimize / restore" Iconify
+ "Maximize / restore" Maximize
+ "Shade / unshade" WindowShade
+ "On every workspace" Stick
+ "Workspace 1" SlateSendDesk 0
+ "Workspace 2" SlateSendDesk 1
+ "Workspace 3" SlateSendDesk 2
+ "Workspace 4" SlateSendDesk 3
+ "" Nop
+ "Close" Close

# Super+Space: launcher; Super+Enter: terminal; Super+D: files; Super+P: run.
# Ctrl+F1..F4 and Super+1..4 switch workspaces; Alt+Tab selects a window.
Silent Key Space A 4 SlateLauncher
Silent Key a A 4 SlatePalette
Silent Key Return A 4 SendToModule FvwmDesktop terminal
Silent Key d A 4 SendToModule FvwmDesktop files
Silent Key p A 4 Module FvwmForm SlateRunForm
Silent Key l A 4 SendToModule FvwmDesktop lock
Silent Key Print A N SendToModule FvwmDesktop screenshot
Silent Key F1 A M SlateLauncher
Silent Key Menu A A SlateLauncher
Silent Key Tab A M WindowList Monitor c c NoGeometry, SelectOnRelease Meta_L
Silent Key F4 A M Close
Silent Key F1 A C GotoDesk 0 0
Silent Key F2 A C GotoDesk 0 1
Silent Key F3 A C GotoDesk 0 2
Silent Key F4 A C GotoDesk 0 3
Silent Key 1 A 4 GotoDesk 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4 GotoDesk 0 1
Silent Key 3 A 4 GotoDesk 0 2
Silent Key 4 A 4 GotoDesk 0 3
Silent Key XF86AudioRaiseVolume A N SendToModule FvwmDesktop volume up
Silent Key XF86AudioLowerVolume A N SendToModule FvwmDesktop volume down
Silent Key XF86AudioMute A N SendToModule FvwmDesktop volume mute
Mouse 1 1 A Menu SlateWindow
Mouse 1 2 A Close
Mouse 1 4 A Maximize
Mouse 1 6 A Iconify
Mouse 1 T A SlateMove
Mouse 1 FS A SlateResize
Mouse 3 T A Menu SlateWindow
Mouse 1 R N SlateLauncher
Mouse 3 R N SlateLauncher
Mouse 2 R N WindowList Monitor c c NoGeometry
Mouse 1 W 4 SlateMove
Mouse 3 W 4 SlateResize

# Export a retained wallpaper pixmap for compositor-free tinted transparency.
*FvwmBacker: CoreOwnedPixmap
*FvwmBacker: Command (Desk *, Page * *) Colorset 20
*FvwmPager: Geometry 640x150
*FvwmPager: Colorset * 0
*FvwmPager: HilightColorset * 13
*FvwmPager: WindowColorsets 1 2
*FvwmPager: Font "$[infostore.slate_font]"
*FvwmPager: BalloonColorset * 0
*FvwmPager: Balloons All
*FvwmIdent: Colorset 0
*FvwmIdent: Font "$[infostore.slate_font]"
# Monitor events have no window ID; use separate event module instances.
*SlateTopology: monitor_enabled SlatePanel
*SlateTopology: monitor_disabled SlatePanel
*SlateTopology: monitor_changed SlatePanel
*SlateWorkspaces: new_desk SlateDesk
DestroyFunc StartFunction
AddToFunc StartFunction
+ I Module FvwmBacker
+ I Module FvwmDesktop
+ I SlatePanel
+ I Module FvwmEvent SlateTopology
+ I Module FvwmEvent SlateWorkspaces
